e's not words."},{"start":402.56,"duration":5.92,"text":"They are control command."},{"start":404.76,"duration":8.36,"text":"It tells model to start sentence."},{"start":408.48,"duration":7.52,"text":"Process a video or handle image."},{"start":413.12,"duration":6.36,"text":"We analyze these special token and found"},{"start":416.0,"duration":7.6,"text":"they fall into four main categories."},{"start":419.48,"duration":8.16,"text":"Boundary like end of text. It simply It"},{"start":423.6,"duration":5.56,"text":"simply tells the model when to stop."},{"start":427.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"Context feeling."},{"start":429.16,"duration":6.76,"text":"These act as placeholder. They mark a"},{"start":432.24,"duration":5.48,"text":"blank space like mask waiting for the"},{"start":435.92,"duration":6.04,"text":"model to fill in."},{"start":437.72,"duration":6.52,"text":"Structure. These define a role like user"},{"start":441.96,"duration":5.52,"text":"versus system."},{"start":444.24,"duration":6.8,"text":"Multi model. They are place hold for"},{"start":447.48,"duration":6.56,"text":"image and visions."},{"start":451.04,"duration":8.4,"text":"As you can see, every major company Open"},{"start":454.04,"duration":8.64,"text":"AI, Meta, Google rely on this logic."},{"start":459.44,"duration":5.64,"text":"We scan the distribution of this token."},{"start":462.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"Please look at the top chart."},{"start":465.08,"duration":5.6,"text":"The thinking and the child role markers,"},{"start":467.64,"duration":4.8,"text":"they just small number, but"},{"start":470.68,"duration":2.88,"text":"look at the big orange bar at the"},{"start":472.44,"duration":3.72,"text":"bottom."},{"start":473.56,"duration":4.64,"text":"They are multimodal tokens. They are"},{"start":476.16,"duration":3.36,"text":"over 1,300"},{"start":478.2,"duration":3.96,"text":"of them."},{"start":479.52,"duration":8.36,"text":"Compared to simple text markers,"},{"start":482.16,"duration":8.52,"text":"multimodal tokens are the vast majority."},{"start":487.88,"duration":4.04,"text":"We also count the specific token by"},{"start":490.68,"duration":2.76,"text":"vendors."},{"start":491.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"Please look at that color."},{"start":493.44,"duration":6.12,"text":"The red bar on the left are green."},{"start":496.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"The teal bars are DeepSeek. The green"},{"start":499.56,"duration":5.2,"text":"bar are Metalama."},{"start":501.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"And and look at the huge yellow bar uh"},{"start":504.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"on the right, that's the Kimiko."},{"start":506.68,"duration":5.52,"text":"Uh some of these models define hundreds"},{"start":509.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"or even thousands of spec token."},{"start":512.2,"duration":4.88,"text":"Why does it matter?"},{"start":513.84,"duration":5.76,"text":"Because more spec token means larger tax"},{"start":517.08,"duration":2.52,"text":"surface."},{"start":519.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"So, what is token injection?"},{"start":522.84,"duration":5.64,"text":"Look at this cartoon on the right."},{"start":525.28,"duration":5.76,"text":"In an ideal world, user text and the"},{"start":528.48,"duration":4.64,"text":"control token are separated."},{"start":531.04,"duration":4.04,"text":"The machines are happy."},{"start":533.12,"duration":4.52,"text":"But, in reality"},{"start":535.08,"duration":5.76,"text":"they are mixed together."},{"start":537.64,"duration":7.64,"text":"Token injection happens when an attacker"},{"start":540.84,"duration":7.16,"text":"put these control token into the input."},{"start":545.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"We trick the infer inference engine into"},{"start":548.0,"duration":4.56,"text":"executing command instead of just in"},{"start":550.76,"duration":5.44,"text":"reading text."},{"start":552.56,"duration":7.04,"text":"It confuse the internal state and boom."},{"start":556.2,"duration":3.4,"text":"The engine is crashed."},{"start":560.8,"duration":4.6,"text":"Let's start with our first case."},{"start":563.84,"duration":2.96,"text":"Vera."},{"start":565.4,"duration":4.24,"text":"As many"},{"start":566.8,"duration":7.4,"text":"of you know, this is one of the most"},{"start":569.64,"duration":4.56,"text":"popular inference engine in the world."},{"start":574.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"Here is our"},{"start":576.0,"duration":5.56,"text":"attack payload. We are targeting the"},{"start":578.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"green vision language model."},{"start":581.56,"duration":6.52,"text":"Normally, you need to upload an image"},{"start":584.12,"duration":7.88,"text":"file to use this model. But here, look"},{"start":588.08,"duration":6.8,"text":"at content, it's text only."},{"start":592.0,"duration":6.2,"text":"We manually injected the special token"},{"start":594.88,"duration":7.76,"text":"video start and video pad."},{"start":598.2,"duration":8.2,"text":"We sent just one single HTTP request and"},{"start":602.64,"duration":3.76,"text":"engine crashed immediately."},{"start":606.84,"duration":8.4,"text":"On the server side, this is what we see."},{"start":610.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"500 internal server error."},{"start":616.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"If you look closely at the log, the"},{"start":618.56,"duration":5.52,"text":"error is index error."},{"start":621.2,"duration":5.6,"text":"List index out of the range."},{"start":624.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"Uh basically, the server is trying to"},{"start":626.8,"duration":5.28,"text":"read data that doesn't exist."},{"start":630.0,"duration":6.4,"text":"The server is confused."},{"start":632.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"It seems video token, so I believe there"},{"start":636.4,"duration":4.44,"text":"is a video."},{"start":637.76,"duration":6.72,"text":"But we didn't upload one."},{"start":640.84,"duration":6.92,"text":"It's like ordering a burger, paying for"},{"start":644.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"it, but open the box and finding"},{"start":647.76,"duration":5.08,"text":"nothing."},{"start":649.6,"duration":6.28,"text":"Wow, it's so easy."},{"start":652.84,"duration":4.92,"text":"Let's trace data flow to see why it"},{"start":655.88,"duration":4.44,"text":"crashed."},{"start":657.76,"duration":3.8,"text":"Please look at the diagram from left to"},{"start":660.32,"duration":2.44,"text":"right."},{"start":661.56,"duration":4.24,"text":"First,"},{"start":662.76,"duration":7.68,"text":"the attack. We send the malicious text."},{"start":665.8,"duration":6.96,"text":"The API and chat layers do not validate."},{"start":670.44,"duration":4.56,"text":"Then just pass it through."},{"start":672.76,"duration":5.64,"text":"Second, the tokenizer."},{"start":675.0,"duration":8.76,"text":"This is a key moment. Tokenizer turned"},{"start":678.4,"duration":8.36,"text":"our text video pad into the number ID"},{"start":683.76,"duration":3.0,"text":"151656."},{"start":687.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"From now on, the system trusts this ID."},{"start":690.48,"duration":5.84,"text":"Finally,"},{"start":691.6,"duration":7.76,"text":"the is crash. The engine sees ID 151656"},{"start":696.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"and thinking, \"Okay, this is the video.\""},{"start":699.36,"duration":4.08,"text":"The code try to get the video size from"},{"start":702.08,"duration":4.32,"text":"list."},{"start":703.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"But, because we never upload a file, and"},{"start":706.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"that list is empty."},{"start":708.16,"duration":7.88,"text":"The code touch the empty list and the"},{"start":711.64,"duration":4.4,"text":"index error. The workers died."},{"start":716.96,"duration":7.04,"text":"Here is the cause in Python code."},{"start":720.0,"duration":6.96,"text":"Look at the variable video nums."},{"start":724.0,"duration":5.36,"text":"The system counts the token to decide"},{"start":726.96,"duration":6.04,"text":"how many videos there are."},{"start":729.36,"duration":4.76,"text":"So, videos nums becomes one."},{"start":733.0,"duration":3.0,"text":"Then,"},{"start":734.12,"duration":5.44,"text":"it enters the loop."},{"start":736.0,"duration":4.96,"text":"It try to access metadata list at index"},{"start":739.56,"duration":5.12,"text":"zero."},{"start":740.96,"duration":5.72,"text":"But, remember, no file was uploaded. So,"},{"start":744.68,"duration":5.64,"text":"the list is empty."},{"start":746.68,"duration":7.2,"text":"Accessing the index zero of an empty"},{"start":750.32,"duration":3.56,"text":"list causes crash."},{"start":754.16,"duration":7.64,"text":"So, strictly speaking, VOM is down"},{"start":758.52,"duration":5.48,"text":"with just a few text token. We killed"},{"start":761.8,"duration":5.08,"text":"the service."},{"start":764.0,"duration":5.88,"text":"But, this is make us wonder,"},{"start":766.88,"duration":6.96,"text":"if most popular engine is vulnerable, is"},{"start":769.88,"duration":6.64,"text":"other infrastructure vulnerable, too?"},{"start":773.84,"duration":5.64,"text":"Let's find out."},{"start":776.52,"duration":5.12,"text":"Next, let's look at our second target,"},{"start":779.48,"duration":5.28,"text":"TensorRT"},{"start":781.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"This is NVIDIA's own high-performance"},{"start":784.76,"duration":3.96,"text":"engine."},{"start":785.8,"duration":6.44,"text":"It's widely used in service"},{"start":788.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"production environment."},{"start":792.48,"duration":6.24,"text":"This is This tag is different. It's a"},{"start":795.64,"duration":4.44,"text":"little complex. We call it two-step"},{"start":798.72,"duration":2.48,"text":"attack."},{"start":800.08,"duration":3.64,"text":"Step one."},{"start":801.2,"duration":4.88,"text":"We send the malicious text payload"},{"start":803.72,"duration":5.16,"text":"contain image path."},{"start":806.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"Result, surprisingly, the server does"},{"start":808.88,"duration":4.08,"text":"not crash immediately."},{"start":810.96,"duration":6.16,"text":"It stays alive,"},{"start":812.96,"duration":7.48,"text":"but internally, its memory is corrupted."},{"start":817.12,"duration":6.96,"text":"It's likely we planted a landmine."},{"start":820.44,"duration":6.4,"text":"Step two, we we send a second request."},{"start":824.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"It can be anything, uh such as hi,"},{"start":826.84,"duration":4.72,"text":"hello anything."},{"start":828.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"It can uh as soon as the second request"},{"start":831.56,"duration":4.76,"text":"hits,"},{"start":832.48,"duration":3.84,"text":"the GPU worker explodes."},{"start":836.44,"duration":5.88,"text":"Let's investigate here in the log."},{"start":838.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"After the first request, we see the C++"},{"start":842.32,"duration":3.96,"text":"error."},{"start":843.48,"duration":6.28,"text":"Assertion failed, chunking is only"},{"start":846.28,"duration":6.0,"text":"possible during the context phase."},{"start":849.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"This proves that, although the process"},{"start":852.28,"duration":5.6,"text":"still running,"},{"start":853.84,"duration":4.04,"text":"the internal state is already broken."},{"start":858.6,"duration":4.92,"text":"Then, after the second request, we get a"},{"start":861.64,"duration":3.72,"text":"fatal error."},{"start":863.52,"duration":3.48,"text":"Look at the red text."},{"start":865.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"CUDA error,"},{"start":867.0,"duration":5.08,"text":"device side assert triggered."},{"start":869.56,"duration":5.8,"text":"This is a very scary error."},{"start":872.08,"duration":5.12,"text":"It means the crash happened deep inside"},{"start":875.36,"duration":4.08,"text":"the GPU hardware,"},{"start":877.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"not just in Python code."},{"start":879.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"The GPU itself said,"},{"start":882.24,"duration":5.08,"text":"\"I cannot handle this data.\" and it"},{"start":884.24,"duration":3.08,"text":"kills process."},{"start":887.8,"duration":5.64,"text":"How did we achieve this?"},{"start":890.76,"duration":3.88,"text":"It's a chain reaction across three"},{"start":893.44,"duration":4.2,"text":"layers."},{"start":894.64,"duration":4.88,"text":"Please follow the dotted arrows."},{"start":897.64,"duration":4.92,"text":"Layer one, Python."},{"start":899.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"We inject the token, the Python logic"},{"start":902.56,"duration":5.56,"text":"calculate garbage dimension for"},{"start":905.24,"duration":5.28,"text":"non-exist image."},{"start":908.12,"duration":5.52,"text":"Layer two, C++."},{"start":910.52,"duration":4.64,"text":"This garbage data cross boundary into"},{"start":913.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"C++."},{"start":915.16,"duration":5.36,"text":"It cause memory corruption."},{"start":917.48,"duration":6.32,"text":"It corrupted the state machine."},{"start":920.52,"duration":6.64,"text":"We didn't dig uh dig deeper to exploit,"},{"start":923.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"but the memory is clearly broken."},{"start":927.16,"duration":4.68,"text":"Layer three, CUDA."},{"start":929.0,"duration":6.4,"text":"Finally, the system tried to launch a"},{"start":931.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"GPU kernel with these invalid numbers."},{"start":935.4,"duration":7.56,"text":"The GPU hardware catch the main catch"},{"start":938.48,"duration":4.48,"text":"the mass error and triggers crash."},{"start":943.88,"duration":5.8,"text":"Let's verify this in code."},{"start":946.48,"duration":7.04,"text":"First, in Python code, the code search"},{"start":949.68,"duration":6.56,"text":"for vision start in the size. Because we"},{"start":953.52,"duration":5.4,"text":"injected the token, it thinks there is a"},{"start":956.24,"duration":4.32,"text":"image. It calculate the highs and the"},{"start":958.92,"duration":4.64,"text":"whites."},{"start":960.56,"duration":6.0,"text":"But since there is no real image,"},{"start":963.56,"duration":6.48,"text":"these value become garbage and they are"},{"start":966.56,"duration":7.32,"text":"passed the C++ engine."},{"start":970.04,"duration":6.24,"text":"Second, the C++ side. The function move"},{"start":973.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"to next contact trunk."},{"start":976.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"It's bad the system to be in a specific"},{"start":979.72,"duration":4.04,"text":"state."},{"start":981.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"But our injected token messed up the"},{"start":983.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"sequence."},{"start":985.36,"duration":4.6,"text":"The assertion failed because the"},{"start":987.76,"duration":5.28,"text":"scheduler is lost."},{"start":989.96,"duration":7.28,"text":"It does it doesn't know which phase"},{"start":993.04,"duration":4.2,"text":"of generation is it is in."},{"start":997.52,"duration":5.12,"text":"Third, the crash."},{"start":999.72,"duration":6.4,"text":"This is a GEMM function, matrix"},{"start":1002.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"multiplication. It takes dimensions M"},{"start":1006.12,"duration":4.16,"text":"and K."},{"start":1008.2,"duration":4.8,"text":"Because of our injection,"},{"start":1010.28,"duration":6.12,"text":"these numbers are wrong."},{"start":1013.0,"duration":6.48,"text":"When we force the GPU to multiply matrix"},{"start":1016.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"with invalid shapes, it trigger a device"},{"start":1019.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"side error."},{"start":1021.2,"duration":6.28,"text":"This is an unrecoverable error."},{"start":1023.8,"duration":7.16,"text":"The service must restart."},{"start":1027.48,"duration":3.48,"text":"Now, let me watch video."},{"start":1031.08,"duration":6.52,"text":"We send the first request"},{"start":1034.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"and the server returns 200 okay. It"},{"start":1037.6,"duration":5.68,"text":"seems fine."},{"start":1039.12,"duration":8.4,"text":"Now, and we send a second request to"},{"start":1043.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"simulate multi-tenant environment."},{"start":1047.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"And we send another request without"},{"start":1050.08,"duration":5.24,"text":"payload."},{"start":1051.84,"duration":7.4,"text":"Finally bombed."},{"start":1055.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"And if we send another request,"},{"start":1062.0,"duration":3.32,"text":"connection refused."},{"start":1070.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"Let's talk about Ollama."},{"start":1073.36,"duration":6.4,"text":"This is most popular tool uh popular"},{"start":1075.64,"duration":4.12,"text":"tool for running LLMs, as well."},{"start":1080.0,"duration":7.16,"text":"For Ollama, we test Gemma 3 uh sorry,"},{"start":1084.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"Gemma 3 models with payload use a"},{"start":1087.16,"duration":3.28,"text":"different token,"},{"start":1088.64,"duration":5.12,"text":"image soft token."},{"start":1090.44,"duration":6.6,"text":"But, the logic is same. We send text"},{"start":1093.76,"duration":6.52,"text":"only. We send a single request. We get"},{"start":1097.04,"duration":3.24,"text":"an immediate crash."},{"start":1101.0,"duration":6.28,"text":"But, look at the log. This is different"},{"start":1103.2,"duration":7.64,"text":"for uh from VRAM. We don't see a nice"},{"start":1107.28,"duration":5.88,"text":"Python error message. We see this."},{"start":1110.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"This is a register dump."},{"start":1113.16,"duration":7.16,"text":"It means the program died violently."},{"start":1117.48,"duration":5.36,"text":"The operating system had to step in and"},{"start":1120.32,"duration":2.52,"text":"kill it."},{"start":1122.96,"duration":5.84,"text":"If we look closer at the tree stack, we"},{"start":1125.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"see the cause, segmentation fault."},{"start":1128.8,"duration":5.96,"text":"The program tried to access memory"},{"start":1130.92,"duration":7.04,"text":"address that did not belong to it."},{"start":1134.76,"duration":3.2,"text":"This is a hard crash."},{"start":1138.0,"duration":4.92,"text":"Why does it happen?"},{"start":1140.24,"duration":4.72,"text":"It's a failure of communication between"},{"start":1142.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"two language,"},{"start":1144.96,"duration":4.56,"text":"Go, Glang, and C."},{"start":1147.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"Please follow the uh follow follow the"},{"start":1149.52,"duration":3.56,"text":"flow in in diagram."},{"start":1151.4,"duration":5.08,"text":"Layer one,"},{"start":1153.08,"duration":5.96,"text":"we send a special token. The go code"},{"start":1156.48,"duration":6.04,"text":"believes there is a image,"},{"start":1159.04,"duration":5.88,"text":"but the image image list is empty."},{"start":1162.52,"duration":6.32,"text":"Layer two, the model calculates the"},{"start":1164.92,"duration":6.28,"text":"dimensions because the input is empty."},{"start":1168.84,"duration":4.2,"text":"They calculate negative or random"},{"start":1171.2,"duration":3.6,"text":"dimensions."},{"start":1173.04,"duration":4.48,"text":"Layer three,"},{"start":1174.8,"duration":7.48,"text":"there this is a critical moment."},{"start":1177.52,"duration":6.32,"text":"Go past these bad number to C engine."},{"start":1182.28,"duration":4.68,"text":"Layer four,"},{"start":1183.84,"duration":5.56,"text":"the C engine blindly trusts the numbers."},{"start":1186.96,"duration":3.96,"text":"It tried to read memory as negative"},{"start":1189.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"offset."},{"start":1190.92,"duration":6.2,"text":"This triggers the segmentation fault and"},{"start":1193.96,"duration":3.16,"text":"the service died."},{"start":1197.52,"duration":5.48,"text":"Now, let's talk about the impact."},{"start":1201.8,"duration":3.64,"text":"First,"},{"start":1203.0,"duration":6.64,"text":"what is the cause?"},{"start":1205.44,"duration":7.4,"text":"It's a in-bind signaling problem."},{"start":1209.64,"duration":4.96,"text":"We are mixing two things into in the"},{"start":1212.84,"duration":5.76,"text":"same streams,"},{"start":1214.6,"duration":7.12,"text":"control signals and user data."},{"start":1218.6,"duration":5.72,"text":"This is exactly like SQL injection, but"},{"start":1221.72,"duration":6.28,"text":"for LLMs."},{"start":1224.32,"duration":6.64,"text":"It the same has a blurry boundary."},{"start":1228.0,"duration":5.2,"text":"It blindly trusts the tokenizer."},{"start":1230.96,"duration":3.68,"text":"Once the tokenizer create a special"},{"start":1233.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"token,"},{"start":1234.64,"duration":4.0,"text":"the model thinks, \"Oh, this is a system"},{"start":1237.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"command.\""},{"start":1238.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"It's executed even though it came from"},{"start":1241.92,"duration":4.96,"text":"malicious user."},{"start":1244.16,"duration":5.68,"text":"The immediately impact the in-memory"},{"start":1246.88,"duration":5.08,"text":"corruption or system crash."},{"start":1249.84,"duration":5.6,"text":"But theoretically"},{"start":1251.96,"duration":6.48,"text":"it opens the door for much worse attack,"},{"start":1255.44,"duration":8.04,"text":"like stealing data or manipulating"},{"start":1258.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"output, the model's inference logic."},{"start":1264.64,"duration":5.08,"text":"This issue is universal."},{"start":1267.08,"duration":3.84,"text":"It affects the core of the LLM"},{"start":1269.72,"duration":4.48,"text":"ecosystem."},{"start":1270.92,"duration":5.64,"text":"We tested popular open source framework."},{"start":1274.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"Please look at icon."},{"start":1276.56,"duration":5.76,"text":"The explosion symbol means"},{"start":1279.4,"duration":5.8,"text":"the entire engine crashed."},{"start":1282.32,"duration":6.36,"text":"The whole service went down."},{"start":1285.2,"duration":6.12,"text":"The red X means the request failed"},{"start":1288.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"causing a denial of service for that"},{"start":1291.32,"duration":4.16,"text":"user."},{"start":1292.76,"duration":6.12,"text":"As you can see, widely used framework"},{"start":1295.48,"duration":5.52,"text":"like vLLM, S3 large, and the NVIDIA"},{"start":1298.88,"duration":6.84,"text":"TensorRT LLM"},{"start":1301.0,"duration":4.72,"text":"all suffer from full engine crashed."},{"start":1306.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"But, it's not just open source code."},{"start":1308.92,"duration":4.56,"text":"It breaks real-world cloud platform,"},{"start":1311.24,"duration":2.24,"text":"too."},{"start":1314.0,"duration":6.16,"text":"So, this meme sums it up perfectly."},{"start":1316.88,"duration":6.8,"text":"The dashboard might say stable, but the"},{"start":1320.16,"duration":5.6,"text":"GPU workers are actually on fire."},{"start":1323.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"Why is this dangerous?"},{"start":1325.76,"duration":3.32,"text":"Because of the multi-tenant"},{"start":1327.76,"duration":4.4,"text":"architecture."},{"start":1329.08,"duration":7.36,"text":"One stacker sending a bad token can"},{"start":1332.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"crash service for everyone else."},{"start":1337.64,"duration":4.44,"text":"It's not just open source code. It"},{"start":1339.6,"duration":6.16,"text":"breaks real-world cloud platform, too."},{"start":1342.08,"duration":7.0,"text":"First, look at Silicon Flow and Med AI."},{"start":1345.76,"duration":5.12,"text":"We simply put the special token in the"},{"start":1349.08,"duration":3.32,"text":"chat box."},{"start":1350.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"And the service maybe breaks"},{"start":1352.4,"duration":4.72,"text":"immediately."},{"start":1355.0,"duration":4.32,"text":"Next is NVIDIA name."},{"start":1357.12,"duration":5.76,"text":"We send a request."},{"start":1359.32,"duration":4.52,"text":"The result of 500 internal server server"},{"start":1362.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"error."},{"start":1363.84,"duration":7.0,"text":"The inference workers crashed instantly."},{"start":1368.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"This even happens to top-tier provider"},{"start":1370.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"like Google Vertex AI."},{"start":1373.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"When we send a payload, we get a failed"},{"start":1376.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"to submit prompt error."},{"start":1378.16,"duration":7.0,"text":"This maybe improves we triggered the"},{"start":1380.64,"duration":6.68,"text":"unhandled error inside Google's backend."},{"start":1385.16,"duration":4.2,"text":"We also test Open Router."},{"start":1387.32,"duration":7.08,"text":"After sending a malicious token, the"},{"start":1389.36,"duration":7.04,"text":"interface say no response generated."},{"start":1394.4,"duration":4.88,"text":"Here is a hugging face. We try to"},{"start":1396.4,"duration":7.16,"text":"describe the image. We injected injected"},{"start":1399.28,"duration":4.28,"text":"the token and the immediate error."},{"start":1403.84,"duration":3.8,"text":"Finally, this is Microsoft Azure AI"},{"start":1406.2,"duration":3.72,"text":"Foundry."},{"start":1407.64,"duration":5.24,"text":"By injecting token, we can confuse to"},{"start":1409.92,"duration":5.96,"text":"see some output like manipulate and"},{"start":1412.88,"duration":3.0,"text":"causing failures."},{"start":1416.48,"duration":4.8,"text":"Let's see it in action. Here is a quick"},{"start":1418.52,"duration":8.24,"text":"demo on Azure."},{"start":1421.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"First, we send end of text 10 tag."},{"start":1427.04,"duration":4.48,"text":"The model response is correct."},{"start":1432.04,"duration":5.08,"text":"The second time we send a message."},{"start":1439.04,"duration":3.44,"text":"It output an other."},{"start":1443.52,"duration":3.92,"text":"Incomprehensible content."},{"start":1453.8,"duration":4.48,"text":"We have seen the crash. The demo is"},{"start":1455.92,"duration":3.32,"text":"over. You might think this is end of"},{"start":1458.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"story."},{"start":1459.24,"duration":6.16,"text":"But we want to go deeper."},{"start":1462.8,"duration":5.12,"text":"We didn't want to stop just crash. Crash"},{"start":1465.4,"duration":5.52,"text":"are bad, but cross-user tag are"},{"start":1467.92,"duration":6.16,"text":"dangerous. So, we design a"},{"start":1470.92,"duration":5.56,"text":"specialized black box fuzzer."},{"start":1474.08,"duration":5.88,"text":"Our goal was to find two things, data"},{"start":1476.48,"duration":6.2,"text":"leaks or and inference manipulation."},{"start":1479.96,"duration":6.24,"text":"For example, can I use special token to"},{"start":1482.68,"duration":8.24,"text":"leak another user conversation? Or can I"},{"start":1486.2,"duration":6.92,"text":"mess with their model logic?"},{"start":1490.92,"duration":4.96,"text":"This are the fuzzer architecture."},{"start":1493.12,"duration":4.64,"text":"It simulate real world cloud environment"},{"start":1495.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"with three process."},{"start":1497.76,"duration":6.32,"text":"Process one, a baseline user. Process"},{"start":1500.72,"duration":5.68,"text":"two, a benign user acting normal."},{"start":1504.08,"duration":3.76,"text":"Process three, attacker sending"},{"start":1506.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"malicious token."},{"start":1507.84,"duration":4.28,"text":"We monitor the traffic if the benign"},{"start":1510.12,"duration":3.04,"text":"user suddenly receive data from the"},{"start":1512.12,"duration":4.8,"text":"attacker."},{"start":1513.16,"duration":5.16,"text":"We know we have cross-user bug."},{"start":1516.92,"duration":4.32,"text":"The result"},{"start":1518.32,"duration":5.64,"text":"uh we failed with the fatter."},{"start":1521.24,"duration":6.44,"text":"We didn't find any low-hanging hanging"},{"start":1523.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"fruit for data exfiltration or influence"},{"start":1527.68,"duration":3.64,"text":"manipulation."},{"start":1529.08,"duration":5.96,"text":"Mhm, however, remember this is only"},{"start":1531.32,"duration":7.12,"text":"black box text. The limitation is in our"},{"start":1535.04,"duration":6.32,"text":"research deeps, not in the tax surface."},{"start":1538.44,"duration":6.16,"text":"We believe this risk is still there. It"},{"start":1541.36,"duration":5.92,"text":"just need more deep white box research"},{"start":1544.6,"duration":2.68,"text":"to trigger it."},{"start":1547.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"Now, the most important part, how do we"},{"start":1550.72,"duration":3.48,"text":"fix this?"},{"start":1552.24,"duration":4.16,"text":"Does nobody care?"},{"start":1554.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"No. Actually, the solution already"},{"start":1556.4,"duration":4.72,"text":"exist."},{"start":1558.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"The hugging face tokenizer library has a"},{"start":1561.12,"duration":4.76,"text":"native defense."},{"start":1562.8,"duration":4.4,"text":"It's a parameter called split special"},{"start":1565.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"tokens."},{"start":1567.2,"duration":6.24,"text":"If you set it true, the tokenizer will"},{"start":1570.0,"duration":6.92,"text":"break the malicious tokens apart."},{"start":1573.44,"duration":6.24,"text":"So, I'm start become the plain text, not"},{"start":1576.92,"duration":6.12,"text":"a control command. It completely"},{"start":1579.68,"duration":5.96,"text":"neutralized the attack."},{"start":1583.04,"duration":5.24,"text":"It sound like perfectly fixed, right?"},{"start":1585.64,"duration":4.64,"text":"But, look at the number."},{"start":1588.28,"duration":5.44,"text":"How many open source models use this"},{"start":1590.28,"duration":7.52,"text":"protection by default?"},{"start":1593.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"Approximately 0%."},{"start":1597.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"Why?"},{"start":1599.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"Because the default setting is false,"},{"start":1601.8,"duration":3.56,"text":"and the problem is a"},{"start":1603.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"compatibility."},{"start":1605.36,"duration":6.32,"text":"If you simply turn it to true, many"},{"start":1608.6,"duration":6.16,"text":"inference engine will fail to start."},{"start":1611.68,"duration":5.68,"text":"So, we are stuck stuck with default"},{"start":1614.76,"duration":2.6,"text":"insecurity."},{"start":1617.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"We reported this issue to the major"},{"start":1620.24,"duration":3.68,"text":"vendors."},{"start":1621.6,"duration":5.2,"text":"The response were mixed."},{"start":1623.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"Real M, Nvidia, Microsoft, and Google"},{"start":1626.8,"duration":5.88,"text":"confirmed this issue and fixed it."},{"start":1629.36,"duration":6.0,"text":"Meta acknowledged it, but called it"},{"start":1632.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"self-DoS, meaning you know you are only"},{"start":1635.36,"duration":5.84,"text":"crash your own session."},{"start":1637.28,"duration":7.04,"text":"MLX starts and not a vulnerability."},{"start":1641.2,"duration":6.16,"text":"And for SD long or llama, we are still"},{"start":1644.32,"duration":3.04,"text":"waiting for a response."},{"start":1647.64,"duration":5.8,"text":"Finally, here are the three takeaways"},{"start":1651.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"from our talk."},{"start":1653.44,"duration":6.32,"text":"New tech service, we are moving beyond"},{"start":1656.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"the prompt injection to token injection."},{"start":1659.76,"duration":4.64,"text":"Simplicity,"},{"start":1661.32,"duration":6.48,"text":"it's scary how easy this is."},{"start":1664.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"One simple chat message can crash an"},{"start":1667.8,"duration":4.4,"text":"entire server."},{"start":1669.32,"duration":6.08,"text":"But, it does not stop here. It's"},{"start":1672.2,"duration":6.08,"text":"vulnerable, can lead to further"},{"start":1675.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"exploitation like cross-user attack,"},{"start":1678.28,"duration":4.32,"text":"data leak, or even manipulating the"},{"start":1680.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"model's inference."},{"start":1682.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"Defense, we need to sanitize the special"},{"start":1685.24,"duration":5.28,"text":"tokens. We cannot blindly trust the"},{"start":1687.6,"duration":2.92,"text":"tokenizer anymore."},{"start":1690.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"That concludes our presentation. We are"},{"start":1692.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"now open for questions."},{"start":1698.43,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"}]}